OL,3,GNEWSAMayor will be elected to help run
OL,4,ANorfolk and Suffolk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor will be elected to run Norfolk
OL,7,Fand Suffolk from May 2028, it has been
OL,8,Fagreed.
OL,10,FSuffolk County Council's cabinet
OL,11,Frenewed its consent to establish the
OL,12,FMayoral Strategic Authority (MSA) for
OL,13,Fthe two counties during a meeting at
OL,14,F14:30 GMT.
OL,16,FIn October, its counterpart in Norfolk
OL,17,Fhad already made that same decision on
OL,18,Fplans for the strategic authority which
OL,19,Fwould oversee transport, skills,
OL,20,Fhousing and economic growth.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
