OL,3,GNEWSAMayor will be elected to help run
OL,4,ANorfolk and Suffolk
OL,5,
OL,6,FRenewed consent was required following
OL,7,Fchanges to the government's mayor
OL,8,Felection timetable and the national
OL,9,Fdevolution framework, and leaders of
OL,10,Fboth councils said they looked forward
OL,11,Fto having "greater control" over local
OL,12,Fdecisions.
